 matching:[['A reason to avoid publishing precise locations','D','D discusses disturbance risk.'],['The importance of protecting several connected habitats','E','E discusses a habitat network.'],['A distinction between recorded movement and its explanation','A','A distinguishes where from why.'],['An observation consistent with more than one cause','C','C discusses food and headwinds.'],['Details of the equipment and the sample','B','B gives bird numbers and tag details.']],
