 matching:[['A warning against using repetition counts alone','B','B discusses copied posts and raw totals.'],['An analogy showing why reference works need updates','E','E compares editing with mapping a moving landscape.'],['The distinction between recording and authorising language','A','A distinguishes description from permission.'],['An explanation of labels attached to entries','D','D explains usage labels.'],['A comparison between two candidate expressions','C','C contrasts diverse evidence with a single campaign.']],
